# Styling and Tokens

- Tailwind-first; avoid inline styles
- Use shadcn/ui components when possible; if unavailable, use Radix UI or create under atoms
- Do not reimplement basic controls (button, input, table)
- SCSS only when necessary; SCSS lives in `/styles`
- No hardcoded px/hex/rgba in components
- Prefer theme token utilities (Tailwind v4)
- Do not rely on color alone to convey AI vs user output
- Keep focus styles visible and contrast accessible

## Charts
- Use shadcn charts or ECharts only
- Charts must be responsive
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders

## Tailwind v4 Rule
- Do not create custom classes that map 1:1 to a single `@theme` token
- If a utility can be derived from `@theme`, use it directly

### Auto-generated mappings (non-exhaustive but authoritative)

COLORS:

- --color-_ →
  text-_
  bg-_
  border-_
  outline-_
  ring-_
  divide-_
  fill-_
  stroke-_
  accent-_
  caret-_
  decoration-_

BORDER RADIUS:

- --radius-_ →
  rounded-_
  rounded-t-_ rounded-r-_ rounded-b-_ rounded-l-_
  rounded-tl-_ rounded-tr-_ rounded-br-_ rounded-bl-_

SHADOWS:

- --shadow-_ →
  shadow-_
  shadow-inset-*

SPACING:

- --spacing-_ →
  p-_ px-_ py-_ pt-_ pr-_ pb-_ pl-_
  m-_ mx-_ my-_ mt-_ mr-_ mb-_ ml-_
  gap-_ row-gap-_ column-gap-_
  space-x-_ space-y-_

SIZE:

- --spacing-_ →
  w-_ min-w-_ max-w-_
  h-_ min-h-_ max-h-*

TYPOGRAPHY:

- --text-_ → text-_ (font-size)
  --font-weight-_ → font-_
  --leading-_ → leading-_
  --tracking-_ → tracking-_

Z-INDEX:

- --z-_ → z-_

OPACITY:

- --opacity-_ → opacity-_

BORDERS:

- --border-_ → border-_ (border-width)

RINGS:

- --ring-_ → ring-_ (ring-width)

FILTERS:

- --blur-_ → blur-_
  --drop-shadow-_ → drop-shadow-_

TRANSITIONS:

- --duration-_ → duration-_
  --ease-_ → ease-_

### Strict prohibitions

- Do NOT create utilities like:
  .text-foo { color: var(--color-foo); }
  .bg-bar { background-color: var(--color-bar); }
  .rounded-baz { border-radius: var(--radius-baz); }
  .shadow-x { box-shadow: var(--shadow-x); }

### Allowed custom utilities only when

- Multiple CSS properties are involved
- State logic is required (:hover, :focus, data-*)
- Child selectors are required
- Component or behavior semantics cannot be expressed by a single Tailwind utility

If there is ANY uncertainty whether Tailwind v4 already provides a utility,
DO NOT add custom CSS.

### Token Rules

- Colors → --color-*
- Spacing → --spacing-*
- Shadows → --shadow-*
- No hardcoded px, hex, or rgba in components
- Hex is allowed only inside @theme
